<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 28.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 28.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate fell 40 basis points to 28.75 percent Wednesday from 29.15 percent Tuesday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>TIIP fell 227.42 basis points to 28.7215 percent Wednesday from 30.9957 percent the week before.</p>
<p>TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is replacing the TIIP, an average interbank rate.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558</p>
</text>
